        <label>Λέξεις κλειδιά</label>
		<span class="fldval" >
				Κλινική Διακυβέρνηση | Ποιότητα Φροντίδας | Ασφάλεια Ασθενών | Συνεχής Βελτίωση | Εκπαίδευση
		</span></li>
<li class="keyword">
        <label>Πρόγραμμα / Ενότητα</label>
		<span class="fldval" >
				ΔΙΟΙΚΗΣΗ ΜΟΝΑΔΩΝ ΥΓΕΙΑΣ,ΔΜΥ50
		</span></li><li class="appendixes"><label>Αριθμός Παραρτημάτων</label><span class="fldval">1</span></li><li class="references"><label>Αριθμός ελληνικών βιβλιογραφικών αναφορών</label><span class="fldval">4</span></li><li class="keyword">
        <label>Αριθμός διεθνών βιβλιογραφικών αναφορών</label>
		<span class="fldval" >
				44
		</span></li><li class="keyword">
        <label>Περιγραφή</label>
		<span class="fldval" >
				ΠΙΝΑΚΕΣ
		</span></li><li class="resource"><label>Αναφορά σε βιβλιογραφικό υλικό του ΕΑΠ</label><span class="fldval">Δικαίος Ν., Κουτούζης Μ., Πολύζος Ν., Σιγάλας Ι., &amp; Χλέτσος Μ. (1999). Βασικές Αρχές Διοίκησης Διαχείρισης (Management) Υπηρεσιών Υγείας, Εκδόσεις Ελληνικό Ανοικτό Πανεπιστήμιο, Πάτρα.</span></li><li class="dissertation_abstract label-field-row">
        <label>Περίληψη (Abstract)</label>
        <ul class="longtext-list"  about="http://arc.altsol.com/archive/item/209442" >
                    <li>
                           &Epsilon;&iota;&sigma;&alpha;&gamma;&omega;&gamma;ή: &Eta; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή &delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta; &mu;&pi;&omicron;&rho;&epsilon;ί &nu;&alpha; &omicron;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&epsilon;ί &omega;&sigmaf; έ&nu;&alpha; &pi;&lambda;&alpha;ί&sigma;&iota;&omicron; ή &sigma;ύ&nu;&omicron;&lambda;&omicron; &alpha;&rho;&chi;ώ&nu; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &pi;&rho;&alpha;&kappa;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ώ&nu; &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &chi;&rho;&eta;&sigma;&iota;&mu;&omicron;&pi;&omicron;&iota;&omicron;ύ&nu;&tau;&alpha;&iota; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &tau;&eta;&nu; &kappa;&alpha;&theta;&omicron;&delta;ή&gamma;&eta;&sigma;&eta; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &tau;&eta;&nu; &epsilon;&pi;ί&beta;&lambda;&epsilon;&psi;&eta; &tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &pi;&alpha;&rho;&omicron;&chi;ή&sigmaf; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &phi;&rho;&omicron;&nu;&tau;ί&delta;&alpha;&sigmaf;. &Sigma;&tau;&omicron;&chi;&epsilon;ύ&epsilon;&iota; &sigma;&tau;&eta;&nu; &epsilon;&xi;&alpha;&sigma;&phi;ά&lambda;&iota;&sigma;&eta; ό&tau;&iota; &omicron;&iota; &alpha;&sigma;&theta;&epsilon;&nu;&epsilon;ί&sigmaf; &lambda;&alpha;&mu;&beta;ά&nu;&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; &alpha;&sigma;&phi;&alpha;&lambda;ή, &alpha;&pi;&omicron;&tau;&epsilon;&lambda;&epsilon;&sigma;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &upsilon;&psi;&eta;&lambda;ή&sigmaf; &pi;&omicron;&iota;ό&tau;&eta;&tau;&alpha;&sigmaf; &phi;&rho;&omicron;&nu;&tau;ί&delta;&alpha;, &sigma;ύ&mu;&phi;&omega;&nu;&alpha; &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&lambda;ύ&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&theta;έ&sigma;&iota;&mu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &alpha;&pi;&omicron;&delta;&epsilon;ί&xi;&epsilon;&iota;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &pi;&rho;&alpha;&kappa;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf;. 

&Sigma;&kappa;&omicron;&pi;ό&sigmaf;: &Omicron; &sigma;&kappa;&omicron;&pi;ό&sigmaf; &alpha;&upsilon;&tau;ή&sigmaf; &tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &mu;&epsilon;&lambda;έ&tau;&eta;&sigmaf; ή&tau;&alpha;&nu; &eta; &delta;&iota;&epsilon;&rho;&epsilon;ύ&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta; &tau;&omega;&nu; &alpha;&nu;&tau;&iota;&lambda;ή&psi;&epsilon;&omega;&nu; &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omega;&nu;  &alpha;&nu;&alpha;&phi;&omicron;&rho;&iota;&kappa;ά &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron; &kappa;&lambda;ί&mu;&alpha; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&epsilon; έ&nu;&alpha; &Gamma;&epsilon;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ό &Nu;&omicron;&sigma;&omicron;&kappa;&omicron;&mu;&epsilon;ί&omicron; &tau;&omega;&nu; &Alpha;&theta;&eta;&nu;ώ&nu;. 

&Upsilon;&lambda;&iota;&kappa;ό &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &Mu;έ&theta;&omicron;&delta;&omicron;&sigmaf;: &Eta; έ&rho;&epsilon;&upsilon;&nu;&alpha; &pi;&rho;&alpha;&gamma;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&omicron;&pi;&omicron;&iota;ή&theta;&eta;&kappa;&epsilon; &sigma;&tau;&omicron; &Gamma;&epsilon;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ό &Nu;&omicron;&sigma;&omicron;&kappa;&omicron;&mu;&epsilon;ί&omicron; &Alpha;&theta;&eta;&nu;ώ&nu; &laquo;&Gamma;&epsilon;&nu;&nu;&eta;&mu;&alpha;&tau;ά&sigmaf;&raquo; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &tau;&omicron; &delta;&epsilon;ί&gamma;&mu;&alpha; &tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &mu;&epsilon;&lambda;έ&tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &alpha;&pi;&omicron;&tau;έ&lambda;&epsilon;&sigma;&alpha;&nu; 120 &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&omicron;&iota; &sigma;&epsilon; &alpha;&upsilon;&tau;ό. &Gamma;&iota;&alpha; &tau;&eta; &delta;&iota;&epsilon;&rho;&epsilon;ύ&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta; &tau;&omicron;&upsilon; &kappa;&lambda;ί&mu;&alpha;&tau;&omicron;&sigmaf; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&tau;&omicron; &nu;&omicron;&sigma;&omicron;&kappa;&omicron;&mu;&epsilon;ί&omicron; &chi;&rho;&eta;&sigma;&iota;&mu;&omicron;&pi;&omicron;&iota;ή&theta;&eta;&kappa;&epsilon; &eta; &epsilon;&lambda;&lambda;&eta;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή έ&kappa;&delta;&omicron;&sigma;&eta; &tau;&omicron;&upsilon; &epsilon;&rho;&omega;&tau;&eta;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&omicron;&lambda;&omicron;&gamma;ί&omicron;&upsilon; Clinical Governance Climate Questionnaire (CGCQ). &Eta; &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&gamma;&rho;&alpha;&phi;&iota;&kappa;ή &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &epsilon;&pi;&alpha;&gamma;&omega;&gamma;&iota;&kappa;ή &sigma;&tau;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή &alpha;&nu;ά&lambda;&upsilon;&sigma;&eta;, έ&gamma;&iota;&nu;&epsilon; &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron; &sigma;&tau;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ό &pi;&alpha;&kappa;έ&tau;&omicron; SPSS έ&kappa;&delta;&omicron;&sigma;&eta; 26. 

&Alpha;&pi;&omicron;&tau;&epsilon;&lambda;έ&sigma;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;: &Tau;&alpha; &epsilon;&upsilon;&rho;ή&mu;&alpha;&tau;&alpha; &delta;&epsilon;ί&chi;&nu;&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; ό&tau;&iota; &tau;&omicron; 67% &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omega;&nu; έ&chi;&epsilon;&iota; &mu;ό&nu;&omicron; &mu;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&kappa;ή &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta; &tau;&omega;&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&delta;&iota;&kappa;&alpha;&sigma;&iota;ώ&nu; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf;. &Tau;&omicron; 45% &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omega;&nu; &mu;&epsilon; &pi;ά&nu;&omega; &alpha;&pi;ό 10 &chi;&rho;ό&nu;&iota;&alpha; &pi;&rho;&omicron;ϋ&pi;&eta;&rho;&epsilon;&sigma;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &epsilon;&mu;&phi;ά&nu;&iota;&sigma;&epsilon; &upsilon;&psi;&eta;&lambda;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&alpha; &epsilon;&pi;ί&pi;&epsilon;&delta;&alpha; &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&epsilon; &sigma;ύ&gamma;&kappa;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&eta; &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron; 25% &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omega;&nu; &mu;&epsilon; &lambda;&iota;&gamma;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&alpha; &alpha;&pi;ό 5 &chi;&rho;ό&nu;&iota;&alpha; &pi;&rho;&omicron;ϋ&pi;&eta;&rho;&epsilon;&sigma;ί&alpha;&sigmaf;. &Eta; &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&chi;έ&tau;&iota;&sigma;&eta; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&xi;ύ &pi;&rho;&omicron;ϋ&pi;&eta;&rho;&epsilon;&sigma;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &epsilon;ί&nu;&alpha;&iota; &sigma;&tau;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ά &sigma;&eta;&mu;&alpha;&nu;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή (r = 0.82, p &lt; 0.05). &Omicron;&iota; &iota;&alpha;&tau;&rho;&omicron;ί &alpha;&nu;έ&phi;&epsilon;&rho;&alpha;&nu; &kappa;&alpha;&lambda;ύ&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&eta; &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta; &tau;&omega;&nu; &pi;&omicron;&lambda;&iota;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ώ&nu; &sigma;&epsilon; &pi;&omicron;&sigma;&omicron;&sigma;&tau;ό 70% έ&nu;&alpha;&nu;&tau;&iota; 50% &tau;&omega;&nu; &nu;&omicron;&sigma;&eta;&lambda;&epsilon;&upsilon;&tau;ώ&nu;, &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&eta; &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&chi;έ&tau;&iota;&sigma;&eta; &nu;&alpha; &epsilon;ί&nu;&alpha;&iota; &epsilon;&pi;ί&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&tau;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&sigma;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ά &sigma;&eta;&mu;&alpha;&nu;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή (Spearman rho = 0.60, p &lt; 0.05). &Epsilon;&pi;&iota;&pi;&lambda;έ&omicron;&nu;, &delta;&iota;&alpha;&pi;&iota;&sigma;&tau;ώ&theta;&eta;&kappa;&epsilon; &mu;&iota;&alpha; &sigma;&eta;&mu;&alpha;&nu;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή &alpha;&rho;&nu;&eta;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&chi;έ&tau;&iota;&sigma;&eta; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&xi;ύ &eta;&lambda;&iota;&kappa;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omega;&nu; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &tau;&eta;&sigmaf; &pi;&rho;&omicron;&theta;&upsilon;&mu;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &alpha;&lambda;&lambda;&alpha;&gamma;ή &sigma;&tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &pi;&rho;&alpha;&kappa;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; (r = -0.76, p &lt; 0.01). &Eta; &sigma;&chi;έ&sigma;&eta; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&xi;ύ &epsilon;&pi;&iota;&pi;έ&delta;&omicron;&upsilon; &epsilon;&kappa;&pi;&alpha;ί&delta;&epsilon;&upsilon;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &tau;&omega;&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&delta;&iota;&kappa;&alpha;&sigma;&iota;ώ&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; ή&tau;&alpha;&nu; &epsilon;&pi;ί&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &sigma;&eta;&mu;&alpha;&nu;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή (r=0.68, p&lt;0.05). &Tau;έ&lambda;&omicron;&sigmaf;, &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&omicron;&iota; &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &epsilon;&mu;&pi;&lambda;έ&kappa;&omicron;&nu;&tau;&alpha;&iota; &epsilon;&nu;&epsilon;&rho;&gamma;ά &sigma;&epsilon; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&delta;&iota;&kappa;&alpha;&sigma;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &lambda;ή&psi;&eta;&sigmaf; &alpha;&pi;&omicron;&phi;ά&sigma;&epsilon;&omega;&nu; &alpha;&nu;έ&phi;&epsilon;&rho;&alpha;&nu; &upsilon;&psi;&eta;&lambda;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&alpha; &epsilon;&pi;ί&pi;&epsilon;&delta;&alpha; &iota;&kappa;&alpha;&nu;&omicron;&pi;&omicron;ί&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &alpha;&pi;ό &tau;&eta;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&sigma;ί&alpha; &tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; (r= 0.85, p &lt; 0.001). 

&Sigma;&upsilon;&mu;&pi;&epsilon;&rho;ά&sigma;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;: &Tau;&alpha; &alpha;&pi;&omicron;&tau;&epsilon;&lambda;έ&sigma;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&alpha; &upsilon;&pi;&omicron;&delta;&epsilon;&iota;&kappa;&nu;ύ&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; &tau;&eta;&nu; ύ&pi;&alpha;&rho;&xi;&eta; &mu;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &tau;&omega;&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&delta;&iota;&kappa;&alpha;&sigma;&iota;ώ&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &alpha;&pi;ό &tau;&eta;&nu; &pi;&lambda;&epsilon;&iota;&omicron;&nu;ό&tau;&eta;&tau;&alpha; &tau;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;&omicron;&mu;έ&nu;&omega;&nu;, &tau;&omicron;&nu;ί&zeta;&omicron;&nu;&tau;&alpha;&sigmaf; &tau;&eta;&nu; &alpha;&nu;ά&gamma;&kappa;&eta; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &beta;&epsilon;&lambda;&tau;&iota;&omega;&mu;έ&nu;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &epsilon;&kappa;&pi;&alpha;&iota;&delta;&epsilon;&upsilon;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &pi;&rho;&omega;&tau;&omicron;&beta;&omicron;&upsilon;&lambda;ί&epsilon;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &pi;&epsilon;&rho;&iota;&sigma;&sigma;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&eta; &sigma;&alpha;&phi;ή&nu;&epsilon;&iota;&alpha; &sigma;&tau;&eta;&nu; &epsilon;&pi;&iota;&kappa;&omicron;&iota;&nu;&omega;&nu;ί&alpha; &tau;&omega;&nu; &pi;&omicron;&lambda;&iota;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ώ&nu;. &Eta; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&phi;&omicron;&rho;ά &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta;&sigmaf; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&xi;ύ &tau;&omega;&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&phi;ό&rho;&omega;&nu; &epsilon;&pi;&alpha;&gamma;&gamma;&epsilon;&lambda;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ώ&nu; &omicron;&mu;ά&delta;&omega;&nu;, &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; &iota;&alpha;&tau;&rho;&omicron;ύ&sigmaf; &nu;&alpha; έ&chi;&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; &upsilon;&psi;&eta;&lambda;ό&tau;&epsilon;&rho;&eta; &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta; &sigma;&epsilon; &sigma;&chi;έ&sigma;&eta; &mu;&epsilon; &tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; &nu;&omicron;&sigma;&eta;&lambda;&epsilon;&upsilon;&tau;έ&sigmaf;, &upsilon;&pi;&omicron;&delta;&epsilon;&iota;&kappa;&nu;ύ&epsilon;&iota; &tau;&eta;&nu; &alpha;&nu;ά&gamma;&kappa;&eta; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &omicron;&mu;&omicron;&iota;ό&mu;&omicron;&rho;&phi;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &epsilon;&kappa;&pi;&alpha;&iota;&delta;&epsilon;&upsilon;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &pi;&omicron;&lambda;&iota;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &pi;&rho;&omicron;&sigma;&pi;ά&theta;&epsilon;&iota;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &nu;&alpha; &alpha;&nu;&tau;&alpha;&pi;&omicron;&kappa;&rho;ί&nu;&omicron;&nu;&tau;&alpha;&iota; &sigma;&tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &alpha;&nu;ά&gamma;&kappa;&epsilon;&sigmaf; &kappa;ά&theta;&epsilon; &epsilon;&pi;&alpha;&gamma;&gamma;&epsilon;&lambda;&mu;&alpha;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή&sigmaf; &omicron;&mu;ά&delta;&alpha;&sigmaf;, &epsilon;&nu;&iota;&sigma;&chi;ύ&omicron;&nu;&tau;&alpha;&sigmaf; &tau;&eta; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&lambda;&epsilon;&iota;&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&rho;&gamma;&iota;&kappa;ό&tau;&eta;&tau;&alpha; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &tau;&eta;&nu; &kappa;&omicron;&iota;&nu;ή &kappa;&alpha;&tau;&alpha;&nu;ό&eta;&sigma;&eta; &tau;&omega;&nu; &delta;&iota;&alpha;&delta;&iota;&kappa;&alpha;&sigma;&iota;ώ&nu;. &Epsilon;&pi;&iota;&pi;&lambda;έ&omicron;&nu;, &eta; &alpha;&rho;&nu;&eta;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ή &sigma;&upsilon;&sigma;&chi;έ&tau;&iota;&sigma;&eta; &mu;&epsilon;&tau;&alpha;&xi;ύ &eta;&lambda;&iota;&kappa;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &pi;&rho;&omicron;&theta;&upsilon;&mu;ί&alpha;&sigmaf; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &alpha;&lambda;&lambda;&alpha;&gamma;ή &sigma;&tau;&iota;&sigmaf; &kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &pi;&rho;&alpha;&kappa;&tau;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &upsilon;&pi;&omicron;&delta;&epsilon;&iota;&kappa;&nu;ύ&epsilon;&iota; &tau;&eta;&nu; &alpha;&nu;ά&gamma;&kappa;&eta; &gamma;&iota;&alpha; &sigma;&tau;&rho;&alpha;&tau;&eta;&gamma;&iota;&kappa;έ&sigmaf; &pi;&omicron;&upsilon; &pi;&rho;&omicron;ά&gamma;&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; &tau;&eta;&nu; &kappa;&alpha;&iota;&nu;&omicron;&tau;&omicron;&mu;ί&alpha; &kappa;&alpha;&iota; &upsilon;&pi;&omicron;&sigma;&tau;&eta;&rho;ί&zeta;&omicron;&upsilon;&nu; &tau;&eta;&nu; &pi;&rho;&omicron;&sigma;&alpha;&rho;&mu;&omicron;&sigma;&tau;&iota;&kappa;ό&tau;&eta;&tau;&alpha;, &iota;&delta;ί&omega;&sigmaf; &sigma;&tau;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; &pi;&iota;&omicron; έ&mu;&pi;&epsilon;&iota;&rho;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf; &epsilon;&rho;&gamma;&alpha;&zeta;ό&mu;&epsilon;&nu;&omicron;&upsilon;&sigmaf;.  

 

&Lambda;έ&xi;&epsilon;&iota;&sigmaf;-&Kappa;&lambda;&epsilon;&iota;&delta;&iota;ά: &Kappa;&lambda;&iota;&nu;&iota;&kappa;ή &Delta;&iota;&alpha;&kappa;&upsilon;&beta;έ&rho;&nu;&eta;&sigma;&eta;, &Pi;&omicron;&iota;ό&tau;&eta;&tau;&alpha; &Phi;&rho;&omicron;&nu;&tau;ί&delta;&alpha;&sigmaf;, &Alpha;&sigma;&phi;ά&lambda;&epsilon;&iota;&alpha; &Alpha;&sigma;&theta;&epsilon;&nu;ώ&nu;, &Sigma;&upsilon;&nu;&epsilon;&chi;ή&sigmaf; &Beta;&epsilon;&lambda;&tau;ί&omega;&sigma;&eta;, &Epsilon;&kappa;&pi;&alpha;ί&delta;&epsilon;&upsilon;&sigma;&eta;.
                        
                        
                    </li>
                    <li>
                           ntroduction: Clinical governance can be defined as a framework or set of principles and practices used to guide and oversee the delivery of clinical care. It aims to ensure that patients receive safe, effective and high-quality care, in accordance with the best available evidence and practice 

Purpose: The purpose of this study was to investigate the perceptions of employees regarding the climate of clinical governance in a General Hospital of Athens. 

Materials and Methods: The research was conducted on a sample from the General Hospital of Athens &quot;Gennimatas,&quot; and the study sample consisted of 120 individuals working in this hospital. The Greek version of the Clinical Governance Climate Questionnaire (CGCQ) was used to investigate the climate of clinical governance in the hospital. Descriptive and inferential statistical analyses were performed using the SPSS v.26 statistical package. 

Results: The findings show that 67% of employees have only a partial understanding of clinical governance processes. 45% of employees with more than 10 years of service showed higher levels of understanding compared to 25% of employees with less than 5 years of service. The correlation between experience and understanding is statistically significant (r = 0.82, p &lt; 0.05). Physicians reported a better understanding of policies at 70% compared to 50% of nurses, with the correlation also being statistically significant (Spearman rho = 0.60, p &lt; 0.05). Additionally, a significant negative correlation was found between the age of employees and their willingness to change clinical practices (r = -0.76, p &lt; 0.01). The relationship between education level and understanding of governance processes was also significant (r = 0.68, p &lt; 0.05). Finally, employees who actively participate in decision-making processes reported higher levels of job satisfaction (r = 0.85, p &lt; 0.001). 

Conclusions: The results indicate that there is partial understanding of governance processes by the majority of employees, highlighting the need for improved educational initiatives and clearer communication of policies. The difference in understanding between various professional groups, with physicians having a higher understanding compared to nurses, indicates the need for uniform educational policies and efforts that address the needs of each professional group, enhancing interoperability and common understanding of processes. Additionally, the negative correlation between age and willingness to change clinical practices indicates the need for strategies that promote innovation and support adaptability, especially among more experienced employees.  

Keywords: Clinical Governance, Quality of Care, Patient Safety, Continuous Improvement, Education.
                        
                        
                    </li>
